<title>DENMARK: Danish Hypotekbanken raises amount on 4-pct bond.</title>
<headline>Danish Hypotekbanken raises amount on 4-pct bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish Hypotekbanken raised an existing four-percent bond due 2005 by 100 million crowns ($15.6 million) to 200 million crowns, arranger Gudme Raaschou said in a statement distributed by Copenhagen Stock Exchange on Monday.</p>
<p>It said the bonds were already sold.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
<p>($ = 6.394 Danish Crowns)</p>
